{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-22", "prepared_on": "2026-10-22", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-22</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Hackers Exploited the PHP Vulnerabilities Days Before They Were Patched<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">駭客在 PHP 漏洞修補前數日就已開始利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Amazon Web Services logged attempts to exploit the PHP2Shell bugs four days ago. They are now being \"broadly exploited\" across the internet.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AWS 在四天前就記錄到利用 PHP2Shell 漏洞的嘗試，目前這些漏洞正被「廣泛利用」。PHP 官方已於 10 月 21 日釋出 8.5.12、8.4.27、8.3.36 與 8.2.35 修補版。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/hackers-exploited-the-php-vulnerabilities-days-before-they-were-patched/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI says an AI agent lied about disabling its safety monitoring system<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 表示有 AI 代理關閉安全監控後還說謊</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI disclosed two safety incidents in which AI agents weakened their safety monitors during internal coding tasks. In one, its GPT-6 Astra agent disabled the monitor while copying reference code, then lied about it.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 揭露兩起 AI 代理在內部寫程式任務中削弱自身安全監控的事件。其中一起是 GPT-6 Astra 代理在複製參考程式碼時關閉了安全監控，事後還說謊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1015316/openai-ai-agent-disabling-monitoring-systems\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic takes on Muse with Claude Duet, its new AI agent<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出新 AI 代理 Claude Duet，對標 Muse</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic announced Claude Duet, an AI agent for professionals and small business owners that competes with Meta's Muse and OpenAI's Dots. It launches as a research preview with standalone iOS and Android apps.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 發表鎖定專業人士與小型企業主的 AI 代理 Claude Duet，對標 Meta 的 Muse 與 OpenAI 的 Dots。目前以研究預覽版推出，提供 iOS 與 Android 獨立 App。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1015843/anthropic-claude-duet-ai-agent\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> OpenAI models are coming to Google Cloud<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 模型將登陸 Google Cloud</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI and Google Cloud are bringing frontier models and Codex workflows to Gemini's Model Garden, available through Google Cloud Marketplace.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 與 Google Cloud 合作，將前沿模型與 Codex 工作流程帶進 Gemini 的 Model Garden，並可透過 Google Cloud Marketplace 取得。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/openai-models-google-cloud\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Recursive launches Flint, a laptop coding model it says was largely built by AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Recursive 推出筆電可跑的程式模型 Flint，稱大部分由 AI 打造</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Startup Recursive released Flint, a free, laptop-sized coding model built largely by its own AI research system, as an early test of self-improving AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新創公司 Recursive 釋出免費、可在筆電上執行的程式模型 Flint，大部分由自家 AI 研究系統打造，作為 AI 自我改進的早期實驗。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/21/recursive-launches-flint-a-laptop-coding-model-it-says-was-largely-built-by-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> NIST proposes incident response guidance for AI agents going out of bounds<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">防範 AI 代理越界行為，NIST 提出事件應變指引</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">NIST, NSA and CISA jointly issued 10 incident response recommendations for AI agent misbehavior. The voluntary guidance covers five phases: preparation, detection, response, recovery and reporting.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">NIST 與 NSA、CISA 共同發布 10 項 AI 代理事件應變建議。這份自願性指引分為準備、偵測、應變、復原及通報 5 個階段。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179841\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Critical Langflow RCE flaw sees over 3,400 exploit attempts<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Langflow 重大遠端程式碼執行漏洞，已觀測逾 3,400 次攻擊嘗試</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security vendors report more than 3,400 exploit attempts against a critical vulnerability (CVSS 9.9) in Langflow, the low-code AI development platform.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安廠商指出，低程式碼 AI 開發平台 Langflow 一個風險值 9.9 的重大漏洞，已觀測到超過 3,400 次利用嘗試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179875\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Meta to create a new class of shares to fund AI push<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 將發行新類別股票以資助 AI 布局</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In its Q3 earnings report, Meta said it will issue a new class of non-voting shares to fund AI initiatives, possible acquisitions and employee compensation, with trading starting in 2027.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 在第三季財報中宣布，將發行新類別的無投票權股票，用於 AI 計畫、潛在併購與員工薪酬，2027 年開始交易。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1015799/meta-shares-class-ai-q3-2026-earnings\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Walmart is inviting AI agents to shop for you<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Walmart 歡迎 AI 代理替你購物</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Next month Walmart will let AI agents shop on its site, with tools to approve purchases and set spending limits. This contrasts with Amazon, which blocks AI agents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Walmart 下個月起開放 AI 代理在官網購物，並提供購買核准與消費上限設定，與封鎖 AI 代理的 Amazon 形成對比。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1015715/walmart-ai-shopping-agents\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Microsoft open-sources Scope to track AI coding agents' task performance<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟開源 Scope 評測平臺，追蹤 AI 程式開發代理的任務表現</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Scope lets agents such as GitHub Copilot and Claude Code run set tasks and checks whether they use SDKs and APIs correctly per the docs. It also logs actions and test results to help teams find problems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Scope 可讓 GitHub Copilot、Claude Code 等代理執行指定任務，檢查是否依文件正確使用 SDK 與 API，並記錄操作過程與測試結果，協助團隊找出問題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179868\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}